\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\f0\fs24\lang9 Autodesk Moldflow Mobile Workstation Runtime\par
\b0\fs20 End User License and Deployment Agreement\par
\par
1. \b Grant of License\b0 : This runtime software is licensed exclusively for internal enterprise operations to monitor Autodesk Moldflow simulation jobs and report simulation progress to authorized mobile devices.\par
\par
2. \b Workstation Operations\b0 : The workstation runtime executes background monitoring processes ('Moldflow Mobile Job Monitor' and 'Moldflow Post-Analyze Agent') to track local Simulation Compute Manager (SCM) jobs and verify completion.\par
\par
3. \b Centralized License Monitoring\b0 : Centralized network license monitoring is executed independently and is not altered by this workstation runtime.\par
\par
4. \b Security\b0 : Workstation enrollment requires a valid one-time enrollment token issued by an administrator. Production credentials and API keys are stored securely in protected system storage.\par
